# Keep line endings deterministic regardless of who edits a file: the
# GitHub web editor, a local editor, or Git's own core.autocrlf conversion.
#
# The repository already stores LF. `eol=lf` makes the working tree match it
# as well, so the checked-out files are byte-identical to what is committed
# and a plain diff against a copy kept outside the repo does not report every
# single line as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
